    "locator": "Static deployed bytecode: selector 2c62fa10 -> 0x5c9 assetsOf = mulDiv(sharesOf,sharePrice,1e18); f5eb42dc -> 0xef9 effective shares includes only unmatured notices and converted generation-compatible pending; maturity predicate 0x1428; claim conversion 0x4aa uses stored exit price. No downloaded code executed.",
    "method": "Add unconverted pending and matured notice once to assetsOf, only after exact runtime-code match and same-block assetsOf == floor(sharesOf*sharePriceWad/1e18). Matured raw pending is already represented by effective shares. Old-generation matured exits use stored exitPrice, including zero; do not discard a matured old-generation payable claim.",
    "limits": "Targeted bytecode and getter/state identity review, not verified Solidity, a full decompilation or an audit. All numerical inputs must be pinned RPC."
