    "locator": "Static deployed bytecode: 0x4148 max(owedFav-wagersDog,owedDog-wagersFav,0); grade 0x2ae4 removes open exposure, moves loser risk-on wagers to house, reserves winning side; settle 0x2db2 early-returns already settled, 0x3000 risk-off, 0x409c yield subtracts ceil(P*i0/i1); 0x4049 credits playerTotal/free balance. No downloaded code executed.",
    "method": "playerTotal is free balances only; custody identity is housePot+playerTotal+lockedWagers+lockedPrincipal. Open reserved exposure is contingent, not payable debt. Decided unpaid bet payouts reconstructed once; settled payout history is already in free balances. Fee counters are lifetime allocations not held liabilities. All assets/claims are wsNET, excluded with own-NET backing.",
    "limits": "Conditional on reviewed bytecode semantics, exact runtime code, token identities and pinned state reconciliations. All positive unsettled risk-off payouts retain locked principal; positive risk-on win/push payouts retain locked wager. Zero residuals in nonnegative reserved/locked-wager/locked-principal stocks can establish aggregate claims despite omitted settled/zero-payable bets, not complete history or verified Solidity. Otherwise omitted bets remain an obligation-discovery gap. Never sum mutually exclusive outcome risks."
  },
